# Sales & Customer Insights Dashboard

## Overview
A Power BI dashboard analyzing customer transactions to uncover sales trends, product performance, and customer behavior.

## Tools Used
- Excel
- SQL Server
- Power BI

## Key KPIs
- Total Sales
- Average Order Value
- Repeat Purchase Rate
- Sales by Region
- Top Products

## Deliverables
- Cleaned dataset (Excel)
- SQL cleaning scripts
- Power BI dashboard (.pbix)
- Insight summary
